  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_WILD_AWAKENS": "The Wild Awakens",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_WILD_AWAKENS_HELP": "Every lair spawns three of its units at once: Barrow (Skeleton), Bear Den (Bear), Goblin Fort (Goblin), Hellfire (Champion), Lion Den (Lion), Ruins (Lizardman). A lair with another civilization's unit on it spawns none. Not played without barbarians."
